pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# M4 collectibles oracle (docs/specs/FREEROAM_COLLECTIBLES.md,
# SPEC-FREEROAM-COLLECTIBLES) on a pinned copy of the reference save (v4).
# Run hidden with the v4 build and
#   PINYON_SHIFT_M5_SAVE_TRACE=1 (the loaded profile body in logs/save-snapshots)
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_cheats=true
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_trace=6 (the player's pose)
# cheat_show_collectibles logs every discount sign and barn find with its
# live position and found state (cheat.collectible); the captures show the
# minimap in free roam and the pause map, before and after the markers.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 10 30000 file pressstart.wmv
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 840 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 864 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 960 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 984 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1080 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1104 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1200 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1224 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1320 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1344 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1400 6000 vehicle
capture 1500 free-roam
input 1530 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1536 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1650 map-before
input 1740 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1746 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
cvar 1780 cheat_show_collectibles true
capture 1900 free-roam-on
input 1930 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1936 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2050 map-on
input 2140 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2146 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2260 free-roam-return
stop 2290
